<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41180" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισφαλ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφάλλομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prone to fall, unstable, precarious,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μεγάλα πάντα ἐπισφαλῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					497d
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εστέρα δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					2.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1155a10
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισφαλές</span> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστι</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1264b6
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. φύσει βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Epit.</u>
					126
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφάλλω</span>) <i>making to fall, misleading,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς βλάβην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.653d
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dangerous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VM</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.413
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καιροί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.66.12
				</span></i>
			 : 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εστάτη, χώρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.29.2
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἀγχιβαθοῦς τῶν ἑλῶν Π̔ωμαίοις
					-σφαλοῦς ἐσομένου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					7.2.5
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισφαλές [ἐστι</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακοῦσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					200
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λῶς, ἔχειν, διακεῖσθαι,</span> to be
				<i>in danger,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.25.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sol.</u>
				13
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. βεβηκώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					4.4
				</span></i>
			 : 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατα, περᾶσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>dubious,</i>
			Adv.
			
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερον</span> Aristeas<i><span class="en">
				314
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
